What are you going to do? 
As an all-round F&B Team Member, you will create memorable experiences for our guests throughout the day. You may start your shift serving breakfast, delight guests with delicious meals during lunch and dinner in our restaurant, or take centre stage at our banqueting events. 
In this versatile role, you will have the opportunity to grow and gain experience across all areas of our dynamic Food & Beverage department. No two days are the same and every shift brings new challenges, learning opportunities and guest interactions. We encourage you to develop your skills, broaden your experience and discover all aspects of the F&B operation. 
We are searching for an enthusiastic hospitality lover and a true team player. Someone who understands how to make a sincere connection with our guests. Therefore, great communication skills in English is a must! Any other language is a great asset to our team. 
What's in it for you? 
Novotel Amsterdam City is one of the largest Accor Hotels and that comes with lots of benefits! We have plenty of growth opportunities in our hotel and worldwide. We also offer; 
- A gross salary of € 2658,05 gross per month based on a 38-hour work week (the salary offered by us is 7.5% higher than the Horeca CAO scale 3); 
- Excellent travel allowance from 5.0 km onwards; 
- 25 vacation days per year based on a full-time contract; 
- You are invited to stay in Novotel Amsterdam City for free with another person. This includes breakfast and a 3-course dinner meal!;; 
- Discount for stays at all Accor hotels worldwide; 
- Free parking in our hotel; 
- Complimentary usage of our fitness area and two massages per month; 
